# Normalise line endings so tools that pattern-match source text behave the
# same on every platform.
#
# Why this exists (F-1, 2026-10-02): `tools/regen_pins.mjs` locates the
# PIN-GENESIS-STAMP block by pattern. `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows turned the
# checked-out file into CRLF, the pattern failed to match, and the pin-genesis
# gate reported `PIN DRIFT: 0 pin(s) differ` while exiting non-zero — a false
# alarm that made the suite red on substance that was in perfect sync.
#
# `eol=lf` makes the working tree match the repository (which stores LF), so a
# gate cannot pass or fail based on whose operating system checked it out.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending translated.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
